  "title": "Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer",
  "summary": "The Montreal Protocol was concluded at Montreal on 16 September 1987 and entered into force on 1 January 1989. It set limits on consumption and production of controlled ozone-depleting substances, beginning with a freeze at 1986 levels.",
